      "text": "**Definition:** rate of disappearance of A per unit volume [mol/(L·s) or mol/(m³·s)]\n```\n-r_A = (−1/V)(dN_A/dt)    (batch, intensive, based on volume)\n     = −dC_A/dt            (constant-volume batch)\n     = k C_A^m C_B^n      (power-law form)"
